#: src/Sync.php:1018 packages/storeabill-lexoffice/src/Sync.php:1018
msgctxt "lexoffice"
msgid ""
"By enabling this option, invoices are transferred to lexoffice automatically "
"as soon as the invoice is finalized."
msgstr ""
"Mit Aktivierung dieser Option werden Rechnungen automatisch an lexoffice "
"übertragen sobald die Rechnung festgeschrieben ist."

