"features</a>. To make your existing documents (invoices, cancellations, "
"packing slips) available within the latest version we will need to import "
"and convert them. Depending on your number of documents that might take some "
"time. The import will be queued and scheduled (processing 10 documents at a "
"time). You can optionally choose to import documents starting from a certain "
"year only. We will not delete old data to make sure no data is lost."
