#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-gzdp-settings-tab-taxes.php:86
msgid "days"
msgstr "Tage"

# @ woocommerce-germanized-pro
#: includes/admin/settings/class-wc-gzdp-settings-tab-taxes.php:94
msgid ""
"Enable positive API reponse cache to ensure that validated VAT IDs won't get "
"checked on every request (leads to better performance). Leave empty to "
"disable caching."
msgstr ""
"Speichere positive API Antworten um zu verhindern, dass bereits validierte "
"USt.-IDs während des hier eingestellten Zeitraumes erneut überprüft werden "
"(kürzere Ladezeiten). Lasse das Feld leer, um den Cache zu deaktivieren."

